# Release: MANDATORY checks (when tagging)

Before merging to `main` or creating a release tag, run **`make release-check`**.

Until `origin` exists, `goreleaser check` is skipped (local-first). After the remote is added, release-check must pass fully before the first tag.

Optional: `STRICT_RELEASE=1` also runs `make docker-scan`.
